{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Introduction to Software Engineering "}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when talking about software engineering."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Understands systems theories, business processes and basic concepts on IT.  Create a map of processes that allows identifying areas in an information system, using IT tools to generate reports based on the company's needs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. Exchanges simple information on IT concepts, systems theory, and diagrams of processes"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about what software engineering is."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe what software engineering is."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Draw a concept map describing what the main concepts of software engineering are."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your concept map with the class and write more concepts if it is necessary."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find information about what software engineering is."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I understand what software engineering is."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I define software engineering concepts briefly."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Simple Present Tense - Verb to Be in Affirmative Form</span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">simple present</span> tense to talk about general actions, routines, and the general state or habits of a subject. The <span class=\"strong\">verb to be</span> is one of the most important verbs in English because it has different functions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the <span class=\"strong\">simple present </span>tense of the <span class=\"strong\">verb to be</span> using the following conjugation (<span class=\"strong\">am, is, are</span>): "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\">I am </span> a software engineer.<br> <span class=\"strong\">You are </span> an intelligent designer. <br> <span class=\"strong\">He is </span> an expert in software application. <br> <span class=\"strong\">She is </span> a good organizer of layering. <br> <span class=\"strong\">It is </span>a good way to organize virtual documents. <br> <span class=\"strong\">We are </span>designers of software. <br> <span class=\"strong\">They are </span>famous for creating a financial software. <br> </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also use contractions to abbreviate the subject and the verb as follows:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To Be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Contraction\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am         \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm        \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You're\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He is        \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She is      \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She's \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is           \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They are  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They' re\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We are     \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" We're\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember, when you refer to a third person, you can use the corresponding personal pronoun or you can mention the specific subject. No matter which one you use, the conjugation is the same: "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">  <span class=\"strong\">They </span> are software engineers. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Mary and Adam </span> are software engineers. <br>  <span class=\"strong\">It </span> is an application to design. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Software engineering </span>is an application to design. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "There are some important concepts that software eng       ineers need to take into account, but they are not difficult to remember. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Future programmers need to know that software engineering is the implementation of engineering principles for software development."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Welcome to Introduction to Software Engineering. I'm Mr. Hardiman."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">What Is Software Engineering? </span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Software engineering integrates different methods to design create, organize and develop computer programs, applications, and data, among others. It also helps to organize all kind of information and documents according to the purpose of the institution or subject who is going to use it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Software engineering is 66 years old and it was essentially created to apply engineering principles to software production. Software is the variable and intangible part of a computer. <br><br>  So when you talk about software you can refer to programs of a particular interest or operating systems; some examples of programs of particular interest are: Paint and the image editing programs; you can also find Linux or Windows as examples of operating systems. <br><br>  Software engineering implies different actions to successfully develop any kind of software: <br><br>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  <li>Research</li> <li>Design</li>  <li>Develop</li> <li>Implement</li> <li>Test</li>  <li>Apply</li> <li>Documentation</li>  <li>Organization</li> <li>Development</li>  <li>Operation</li> <li>Maintenance</li>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "This process helps to produce software for multiple purposes, such as business, industry, financial services, scientific data and some others. All these steps in software engineering need to be consistent and efficient to integrate a functional software."}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob01img01.jpg"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "engineering "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the use of scientific and mathematical values to any process for the plan, production, and task of an expected result"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need to review some essential aspects that define software engineering."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob01aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "layering "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "programming into something that works as a ssegments or parts of a bigger component"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Layering is the programming of different separate components that interact in a hierarchical or sequential way."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob01aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "enable "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make something possible"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We also have conventions and templates that enable automation in software design."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob01aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "readable  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "easy to read and understand"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The code that they write needs to be clean, compact, and readable."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob01aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "handle "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to manage; to be able to deal with something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  It helps companies minimize software cost and handle big projects."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob01aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can give brief information about what software engineering is. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can identify which are the main concepts in software engineering."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can briefly explain the importance of software engineering."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What is computer software?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Do you think there is a difference between computer software and computer program?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": 