model of a real or imaginary system. We also have conventions and templates that enable automation in software design. Additionally, layering is the programming of different separate components that interact in a hierarchical or sequential way. Finally, when coding, engineers have to take into account the algorithmic complexity; the code that they write needs to be clean, compact, and readable.</div>"}, {"time": "90000", "image": "enpe8n1le01ob01re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<div align=\"justify\">As you all can see, software engineering is an important field of engineering in the modern world. It helps companies minimize software cost and handle big projects. It also helps them increase productivity, guarantee the safety of sensitive data, and reduce the complexity or difficulty of tasks.</div>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n1le01ob01re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}